# PD1936 device fragment, applied after soc:configs/sm8150.config.
#
# The upstream 17.x chain pulls in components this board does not select yet, and the
# XNU link step asserts that their archives exist:
#
#   * ADRENO       -- sm8150.config sets CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ADRENO=y, which needs
#                    $ADRENO_ARCHIVE from the nabu-only NabuAdreno component.
#   * LEGACY_DISPLAY -- requires $LEGACY_DISPLAY_ARCHIVE; no display component is
#                    selected for this board (the panel preset does not even exist
#                    in the firmware XMLs yet).
#
# Turn both off to get a linkable kernel. Re-enable each one together with the
# component that provides its archive.
# CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ADRENO is not set
# CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_LEGACY_DISPLAY is not set
